m at BJ Government Medical College. The initiative aims to enhance research, medical training, and patient care for underserved communities in Pune. Collaborating with Johns Hopkins University, the program will focus on public health challenges like tuberculosis and HIV. Faculty and student exchanges are also planned to foster international cooperation in medicine.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-american-physician-navin-shah-commits-525000-to-infectious-disease-program-in-pune/articleshow/135189974.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-american-physician-navin-shah-commits-525000-to-infectious-disease-program-in-pune/articleshow/135189974.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T17:30:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">E.K. Balachandran</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135190091,imgsize-60866.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Don’t encourage Jinnah worship’: Keralam BJP chief Chandrashekhar targets CM Satheesan amid Fort Kochi video row]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-encourage-jinnah-worship-keralam-bjp-chief-chandrashekhar-targets-cm-satheesan-amid-fort-kochi-video-row/articleshow/135189828.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135189828.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-encourage-jinnah-worship-keralam-bjp-chief-chandrashekhar-targets-cm-satheesan-amid-fort-kochi-video-row/articleshow/135189828.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-encourage-jinnah-worship-keralam-bjp-chief-chandrashekhar-targets-cm-satheesan-amid-fort-kochi-video-row/articleshow/135189828.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T17:28:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135190311,imgsize-96898.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[BSF apprehends four Pakistani fishermen in Kutch, seizes boat]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bsf-apprehends-four-pakistani-fishermen-in-kutch-seizes-boat/articleshow/135190136.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135190136.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[On Sunday, four Pakistani fishermen were intercepted by the Border Security Force in the Kutch district of Gujarat. Suspected of illegally fishing in Indian waters for crabs, they were detained following precise intelligence alerts. The crew members, hailing from Chach Jaan Khan village in Sindh province, are now under investigation as the BSF maintains vigilance over the sensitive border region to thwart unauthorized entries.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bsf-apprehends-four-pakistani-fishermen-in-kutch-seizes-boat/articleshow/135190136.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bsf-apprehends-four-pakistani-fishermen-in-kutch-seizes-boat/articleshow/135190136.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T17:17:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135190165,imgsize-246998.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Too deferential to govt': Former SC judge questions ex-CJI Chandrachud’s approach to appointments]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/too-deferential-to-govt-former-sc-judge-questions-ex-cji-chandrachuds-approach-to-appointments/articleshow/135189942.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timeso